Why?

00:14:03.843 --> 00:14:06.244
Why do you know you're my first love?

00:14:07.413 --> 00:14:11.372
I'm not as kind as you think I am.

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:14.483
And I'll probably hurt you.

00:14:15.855 --> 00:14:18.722
Earnest love and things like that...

00:14:19.291 --> 00:14:20.850
I'm not good with those.

00:14:22.862 --> 00:14:25.354
Tell everyone that I went home early.

00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:43.124
Did you find Ran?

00:14:43.148 --> 00:14:44.526
| didn't see her.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.862
It looks like maybe she left.

00:14:46.886 --> 00:14:49.378
Honestly! I told her to wait!

00:14:49.788 --> 00:14:51.566
Hey, what about the junior detectives?!

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.968
Again?

00:14:52.992 --> 00:14:55.086
Oh, not Sayo too!

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.123
I'm gonna die.

00:15:02.968 --> 00:15:05.413
Must eat something!

00:15:05.437 --> 00:15:07.015
Oh, Aya!

00:15:07.039 --> 00:15:08.717
Ran!

00:15:08.741 --> 00:15:11.176
Hey, where's Otohata?

00:15:11.844 --> 00:15:13.744
He went home.

00:15:16.215 --> 00:15:18.513
| got rejected.

00:15:21.787 --> 00:15:25.223
You told him that he was
my first love, didn't you?

00:15:25.858 --> 00:15:27.335
Sorry.

00:15:27.359 --> 00:15:29.604
If you would've just said something...

00:15:29.628 --> 00:15:32.073
Ran?

00:15:32.097 --> 00:15:33.724
Otohata, that bastard!

00:15:35.901 --> 00:15:37.426
Ran, what's the matter?

00:15:37.937 --> 00:15:40.065
| can't go on. Feed me something.

00:15:41.407 --> 00:15:44.342
Detective Kotobuki, how are things
looking over there? Over.

00:15:44.743 --> 00:15:47.440
Unfortunately, I haven't found
any clues, chu. Over.

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:52.360
Since it's come to this,

00:15:52.384 --> 00:15:54.429
we'll request Assistant Inspector
Yamazaki to back us up, datchu!

00:15:54.453 --> 00:15:55.330
Roger!

00:15:55.354 --> 00:15:56.822
Off we go!

00:15:58.857 --> 00:16:02.088
Detective Kotobuki! Are you okay,
Detective Kotobuki?!

00:16:03.629 --> 00:16:04.839
| want...

00:16:04.863 --> 00:16:08.800
| want to eat tea on salmon and rice
one last time, datchu!

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:11.998
Don't die! Don't die,
Detective Kotobuki!

00:16:12.471 --> 00:16:13.481
Datchu!

00:16:13.505 --> 00:16:14.597
Okay, cut!

00:16:15.507 --> 00:16:17.236
Let's do the next scene!

00:16:17.876 --> 00:16:20.311
Detective Kotobuki, it looks
like a clue! Over.

00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:22.157
Roger, datchu!

00:16:22.181 --> 00:16:23.478
Off we go!

00:16:29.922 --> 00:16:31.032
| feel revived!

00:16:31.056 --> 00:16:32.581
Oh, Ran.

00:16:34.393 --> 00:16:34.936
Miyu
Yamazaki

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:35.937
Miyu Yamazaki It's Miyu.

00:16:35.961 --> 00:16:36.338
It's Miyu.

00:16:36.362 --> 00:16:38.206
Hey, where are you?

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.756
What?! Sayo and Masato
disappeared again?!

00:16:43.902 --> 00:16:45.981
We've finally made it
to the front, ch...

00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:48.016
It certainly was a long journey.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.718
Quiet!

00:16:49.742 --> 00:16:51.301
Ready?!

00:16:52.011 --> 00:16:53.536
Start!

00:16:58.751 --> 00:17:00.762
Detective Kudoh!

00:17:00.786 --> 00:17:02.263
It's the real thing!

00:17:02.287 --> 00:17:05.518
You'd better give up, now that the
Odaiba Shark's eyes are on you.

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:07.824
Damn it!

00:17:15.267 --> 00:17:17.045
Detective Kudoh's been...

00:17:17.069 --> 00:17:18.662
It can't be!

00:17:19.905 --> 00:17:21.449
Detective Kudoh!

00:17:21.473 --> 00:17:22.817
You can't die, datchu!

00:17:22.841 --> 00:17:24.570
Please hang in there,
Detective Kudoh!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.588
Hey...

00:17:26.612 --> 00:17:28.623
Don't tell me... Not again?

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:29.591
Looks like it.

00:17:29.615 --> 00:17:31.159
Detective Kudoh!

00:17:31.183 --> 00:17:32.360
You guys...

00:17:32.384 --> 00:17:34.512
You can't die, datchu!

00:17:36.055 --> 00:17:38.285
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:17:41.493 --> 00:17:43.484
But I'm fine.

00:17:48.467 --> 00:17:50.629
The Odaiba Shark never sleeps.

00:17:53.472 --> 00:17:56.032
Detective Kudoh!

00:17:57.376 --> 00:18:00.539
The Odaiba Cop is forever, datchu!

00:18:01.613 --> 00:18:02.724
Sayo...

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:05.326
Oh, Assistant Inspector Yamazaki
has been sighted!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.261
Assistant Inspector?

00:18:06.285 --> 00:18:08.530
How far did that guy go?

00:18:08.554 --> 00:18:11.099
Oh, yeah, datchu! Sis is
in big trouble, datchu!

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:14.684
She's got a duel with Mami Honda
at the Marine Park at 5 o'clock, datchu!

00:18:15.227 --> 00:18:16.838
Is this true?

00:18:16.862 --> 00:18:19.441
It'll be dangerous, so you two stay here!

00:18:19.465 --> 00:18:20.375
Roger!

00:18:20.399 --> 00:18:22.367
It's almost 5 o'clock!

00:18:23.135 --> 00:18:24.899
But we're gonna be t-ing them in secret.

00:18:30.142 --> 00:18:31.686
She's late.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.822
She's way too late!

00:18:33.846 --> 00:18:36.057
Have you chickened out, Kotobuki?!

00:18:36.081 --> 00:18:37.913
Oh, here she comes!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.563
Ran, you have a duel?
| came running when I heard!

00:18:41.587 --> 00:18:43.131
Oh, I forgot about that.

00:18:43.155 --> 00:18:44.884
Are you making fun of me?!

00:18:45.757 --> 00:18:47.953
But now's your chance,
if you want to run.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.122
You're afraid of fighting me
one-on-one, aren't you?

00:18:51.697 --> 00:18:52.740
What?

00:18:52.764 --> 00:18:54.876
Let's hear you say that again!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:55.977
You're pitiful.

00:18:56.001 --> 00:18:58.746
You put the leadership
of Shibuya to shame.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.583
This'll be good to work off what
| just ate, so I'll take you on!

00:19:01.607 --> 00:19:03.541
You better not start crying.

00:19:04.176 --> 00:19:06.838
Aren't your methods a little dirty
for a one-on-one fight?

00:19:07.779 --> 00:19:09.858
Hey! What?! Why the hell
are you guys here?!

00:19:09.882 --> 00:19:11.359
Darn, she saw us.

00:19:11.383 --> 00:19:13.361
That was totally unnecessary!

00:19:13.385 --> 00:19:14.829
You guys stay out of this!

00:19:14.853 --> 00:19:16.531
| don't mind.

00:19:16.555 --> 00:19:20.048
You can send as many of those
small fry as you want after me.

00:19:20.959 --> 00:19:23.587
To hell with it! Get her!

00:19:24.796 --> 00:19:28.357
<i>Youse guys are a piece
of cake for me!</i>

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.325
Cake!

00:19:30.702 --> 00:19:32.227
This is nothing!

00:19:34.506 --> 00:19:36.050
Amazing! She's amazing, datchu!

00:19:36.074 --> 00:19:38.202
It's Sis's Hometown Tokyo attack!

00:19:38.477 --> 00:19:40.741
Looks like she doesn't need Miyu's help.

00:19:42.147 --> 00:19:43.842
You damn fool!

00:19:45.884 --> 00:19:47.896
Damn you, Kotobuki!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.550
I'm not gonna be satisfied until
| punch you at least once!

00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:54.288
Come back the day before yesterday!

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:01.476
Hey, Honda, if you wanna run,
now's your chancel

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.846
Shuddup! I'll fight you in
the name of Bukuro!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.948
Loser becomes the underling!

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:08.550
Sounds fun!

00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:10.269
Take that!

00:20:11.443 --> 00:20:12.933
Not so fast!

00:20:16.481 --> 00:20:18.472
I'll admit that you've got guts!

00:20:18.917 --> 00:20:22.597
But if you think you can win against
the great Ran Kotobuki,

00:20:22.621 --> 00:20:25.556
you're five billion years
ahead of yourself!

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:27.669
Ran!

00:20:27.693 --> 00:20:29.137
Ran, you're so strong!

00:20:29.161 --> 00:20:31.653
This super-sucks!

00:20:32.164 --> 00:20:33.675
WV

00:20:33.699 --> 00:20:35.677
Sis, congratulations!

00:20:35.701 --> 00:20:38.033
Shibuya will be safe for a while now.

00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:39.747
Penalty game, datchu!

00:20:39.771 --> 00:20:40.782
Roger!

00:20:40.806 --> 00:20:42.350
All right!

00:20:42.374 --> 00:20:47.222
Shibuya is #1, Bukuro is #2.
QOdaiba hole-filling penalty game.

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:49.657
Shibuya is the greatest,
the train is Saikyo.

00:20:49.681 --> 00:20:49.757
Shibuya and Bukuro are both
on the Saikyo Line.

00:20:49.781 --> 00:20:52.560
Mami, why do you think we lost? Shibuya
and Bukuro are both on the Saikyo Line.

00:20:52.584 --> 00:20:53.394
Shibuya and Bukuro are both
on the Saikyo Line.

00:20:53.418 --> 00:20:56.046
Probably the fact that Kotobuki's
stomach was full.

00:20:56.955 --> 00:20:58.719
You did pretty good.

00:20:59.191 --> 00:21:01.469
It'd be a waste to keep you as an underling.

00:21:01.493 --> 00:21:02.637
Datchu!
Kotobuki?

00:21:02.661 --> 00:21:02.923
Kotobuki?

00:21:03.996 --> 00:21:06.055
A loss is a loss, it can't be helped.

00:21:07.432 --> 00:21:10.026
I'll acknowledge you as one of my friends.

00:21:10.569 --> 00:21:13.595
Shibuya and Bukuro, let's
get along from now on.

00:21:16.108 --> 00:21:17.598
Kotobuki...

00:21:18.744 --> 00:21:20.803
This cocky and easygoing attitude...

00:21:22.247 --> 00:21:23.891
| can't keep up with it.

00:21:23.915 --> 00:21:25.460
Let's go home.

00:21:25.484 --> 00:21:27.111
Buh-bye!

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:29.497
Ran!

00:21:29.521 --> 00:21:31.216
Easy win!

00:21:34.359 --> 00:21:35.849
Isn't it beautiful?

00:21:39.097 --> 00:21:40.908
It's night already.

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.560
The day sure went by fast today.

00:21:46.838 --> 00:21:51.275
You know, there's no time to be
depressed when I'm around you, Ran.

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:53.636
That's so true.

00:21:55.213 --> 00:21:58.945
Say, Aya, it's not like Otohata said
he didn't like you, right?

00:22:00.585 --> 00:22:02.815
Then don't give up and go for it.

00:22:03.655 --> 00:22:06.681
You're right. I'm a mole after all.

00:22:07.893 --> 00:22:11.572
| can just make my way slowly
without rushing things, right?

00:22:11.596 --> 00:22:13.374
Yeah, go for it, mole!

00:22:13.398 --> 00:22:15.560
Okay, I'll be fine.

00:22:16.935 --> 00:22:19.996
A mole doesn't give up so easily.

00:22:21.173 --> 00:22:22.984
Man, feeling relieved is
making me hungry!

00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:24.485
What?! Again?!

00:22:24.509 --> 00:22:25.999
Oh, Ran.

00:22:29.114 --> 00:22:30.425
Odaiba Cop!

00:22:30.449 --> 00:22:31.917
Datchu!

00:22:33.819 --> 00:22:34.752
Cut!

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:41.669
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:41.693 --> 00:22:47.860
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:54.615
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.639 --> 00:22:59.941
And no one needs me...

00:23:00.912 --> 00:23:07.195
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.219 --> 00:23:12.988
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.558 --> 00:23:19.841
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:19.865 --> 00:23:25.580
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:31.543
| was so envious of you

00:23:31.943 --> 00:23:37.525
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.549 --> 00:23:45.066
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:51.005
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.029 --> 00:23:57.678
If only I had more courage

00:23:57.702 --> 00:24:04.108
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:05.753
Next Super GALS!

00:24:05.777 --> 00:24:07.622
Next Super GALS!
Summer, summer, coconuts, summer girl!

00:24:07.646 --> 00:24:08.523
Next Super GALS! The season for
gals is here! But I'm super dirt poor.

00:24:08.547 --> 00:24:10.825
The season for gals is here!
But I'm super dirt poor.

00:24:10.849 --> 00:24:12.560
| want to turn my skin a golden brown,

00:24:12.584 --> 00:24:14.562
but I don't have the money
to go to a sun-salo.

00:24:14.586 --> 00:24:16.097
| guess I'll work, since I've got
no other choice.

00:24:16.121 --> 00:24:17.598
Sun, sun, sun, sunshine!

00:24:17.622 --> 00:24:18.800
With the vast ocean in front

00:24:18.824 --> 00:24:21.002
and casting sidelong glances
at the hot couple,

00:24:21.026 --> 00:24:22.103
| work diligently.

00:24:22.127 --> 00:24:24.238
It's really busy, working at
a beach house,

00:24:24.262 --> 00:24:26.774
but I get to earn money AND
get a tan! It's super-great!

